    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_001",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "The booking says you had a urine dipstick done at your check-up, and it showed something. What did they tell you?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:00",
      "end_timestamp": "00:10",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_002",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Well, the nurse did it and said there was protein in it, or a trace, I think. I didn't really follow what that means.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:12",
      "end_timestamp": "00:24",
      "supports": [
        "procedures_and_investigations[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Hmm. Now you mention it, there's been a lot of froth when I go. Like bubbles on top, a bit like washing-up liquid.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:37",
      "end_timestamp": "00:49",
      "supports": [
        "chief_complaint",
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "About three weeks, I'd say. Maybe a bit longer, but I only started really looking recently.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:15",
      "end_timestamp": "01:24",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Most mornings, first thing. Less so later in the day. It's not every single time.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:35",
      "end_timestamp": "01:44",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "Does anyone in the family have trouble with their kidneys?",
      "start_timestamp": "03:39",
      "end_timestamp": "03:45",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "My dad did. He had kidney trouble in his sixties, and ended up seeing a specialist at the big hospital.",
      "start_timestamp": "03:47",
      "end_timestamp": "03:56",
      "supports": [
        "medical_history.family_history[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Not really. I had my gallbladder out about six years ago, but that was all sorted.",
